    <bpmn:process id="W_W4906" name="W4906. Audio / Signage Equipment Lifecycle, Asset Management &amp; Refresh Capex" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Asset end-of-life; refresh cycle; new-store/remodel (VS-37/VS-109); tech obsolescence
Frequency: Continuous lifecycle + multi-year refresh capex
Volume: ~speakers/amps/mics/screens/players/scent-dispensers per store × 205 sites × ~5–7-yr refresh
Owner: In-Store Media Manager / Asset Mgmt (VS-35) / IT (VS-99) / Facilities (VS-138)
Participants: Asset Mgmt (VS-35), IT (VS-27/VS-99), Facilities (VS-138), Capex (VS-40), Vendor (W4910)
Source: workflow W4906 — Audio / Signage Equipment Lifecycle, Asset Management &amp; Refresh Capex</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4906_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4906_Lane1" name="Asset Mgmt">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4906_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4906_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4906_Lane2" name="In-Store Media Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4906_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4906_Lane3" name="Facilities">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4906_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4906_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4906_Start5" name="Asset end-of-life; refresh cycle; new-store/remodel (VS-37/VS-109); tech obsolescence">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4906_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4906_Task6" name="Maintain the AV asset register (VS-35/VS-99): every…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the AV asset register (VS-35/VS-99): every player/screen/speaker/amp/mic/scent-dispenser tagged with location, install date, warranty, firmware, and refresh-due date; integrate with health monitoring (W4900) and the signage/music platforms
Responsible (R): Asset Mgmt / IT / In-Store Media Manager
Accountable (A): In-Store Media Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4906_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4906_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4906_Task7" name="Plan the refresh capex: multi-year AV refresh aligned to tech obsolescence (LED…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Plan the refresh capex: multi-year AV refresh aligned to tech obsolescence (LED signage lifecycle, player firmware EOL), the store-remodel program (VS-109), and new-store openings (VS-37); build the business case and route via the capex gate (VS-40/VS-112)
Responsible (R): In-Store Media Manager / Asset Mgmt / Capex / PMO
Accountable (A): VP Marketing / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4906_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4906_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4906_Task8" name="Execute refresh &amp; responsible disposal: deploy new AV, retire/recycle old units…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Execute refresh &amp; responsible disposal: deploy new AV, retire/recycle old units (e-waste VS-157/VS-99 secure disposal, data-wipe on signage players), update the asset register, and verify post-refresh playback (W4908)
Responsible (R): Facilities / IT / Asset Mgmt / Vendor
Accountable (A): In-Store Media Manager
Duration: Per refresh</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4906_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4906_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4906_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4906_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-736 (ensure controlled execution — Ambient Media Analytics, Technology &amp; Program Assurance (PA-168.3).) | - CTL-736: asset register current; refresh capex via VS-40 gate; secure data-wipe on disposal (VS-99); post-refresh verified
Owner: In-Store Media Manager / Asset Mgmt (VS-35) / IT (VS-99) / Facilities (VS-138)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4906_Assoc11" sourceRef="W4906_Annotation10" targetRef="W4906_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
