    <bpmn:process id="W_W4908" name="W4908. Music Licensing Compliance Audit, Royalty True-Up &amp; Records" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual audit; FILSCAP/society inspection; royalty true-up; internal-audit plan (VS-21)
Frequency: Annual + on inspection/audit
Volume: ~1 group compliance audit/year + ad-hoc FILSCAP inspections
Owner: Legal (VS-100.3) / In-Store Media Manager / Internal Audit (VS-21)
