        <bpmn:outgoing>W4908_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4908_Task4" name="Audit music-license compliance: verify FILSCAP/society blanket licenses are…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Audit music-license compliance: verify FILSCAP/society blanket licenses are current for all 205 sites (W4891), cross-check programmed playlists (W4890) vs license coverage, confirm the rights-clearance allocation with the provider (W4892), and reconcile the fee-base (area/speakers/sites) vs actual
Responsible (R): Legal / In-Store Media Manager / Audit
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4908_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4908_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4908_Task5" name="Conduct the royalty true-up: reconcile actual music use/sites/speakers vs the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Conduct the royalty true-up: reconcile actual music use/sites/speakers vs the license fee paid, process any top-up or refund, update the renewal calendar (VS-166), and manage any FILSCAP inspection/site-visit response
Responsible (R): Legal / Finance / In-Store Media Manager
Accountable (A): VP Legal / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4908_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4908_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4908_Task6" name="Maintain the audit-ready evidence file: licenses, certificates…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Maintain the audit-ready evidence file: licenses, certificates, playlists/coverage logs, fee payments, true-up records, and inspection correspondence; retain per the records policy (VS-88) and supply to internal audit (VS-21) and external auditors on request
Responsible (R): Legal / Records (VS-88) / Audit
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4908_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
