      <bpmn:userTask id="W4909_Task6" name="Enforce Consumer Act (RA 7394) price-integrity: ensure signage promo prices…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Enforce Consumer Act (RA 7394) price-integrity: ensure signage promo prices match POS/shelf (links VS-151), mandatory price/tag notices are correct, and PWD/senior-discount notices (VS-85) are displayed; manage any price-integrity complaint (VS-13)
Responsible (R): Legal/Compliance / In-Store Media Manager / Marketing
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4909_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4909_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4909_Task7" name="Manage accessibility (RA 7277/BP 344): accessible signage (contrast, font…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manage accessibility (RA 7277/BP 344): accessible signage (contrast, font, PWD-reachable placement), PA/announcements with visual accompaniment where feasible for hearing-impaired customers, and inclusive content; coordinate with customer-safety/premises (VS-147)
Responsible (R): CX / Accessibility Lead / In-Store Media Manager
Accountable (A): VP Marketing / VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4909_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4909_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4909_Task8" name="Manage voice/privacy compliance (RA 10173): any voice-capture (announcements…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage voice/privacy compliance (RA 10173): any voice-capture (announcements, footfall/voice analytics) under consent/data-minimization, customer-name paging only with consent (W4897), signage/footfall data governance (links VS-91), and DPIA for any new voice/analytics tech (W4911)
Responsible (R): Privacy/DPO / In-Store Media Manager / Legal
Accountable (A): DPO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4909_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
