        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Govern vendor SLA &amp; performance: track uptime (music service, signage CMS), content-delivery/refresh timeliness, catalog/localization quality, issue-resolution, and the rights-clearance obligation (W4891/W4892); run periodic business reviews
Responsible (R): In-Store Media Manager / Procurement / Analytics
