        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manage TPRM (VS-161): cyber attestation for signage/music platforms (VS-27.3), financial DD, DPA/privacy (VS-91), concentration (single music-service dependency), and fourth-party sub-processors; integrate to the enterprise TPRM register
Responsible (R): TPRM / Procurement / Cyber / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Marketing / TPRM Lead
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4910_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4910_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4910_Task8" name="Manage contract lifecycle: renewals, re-competes (W4892), performance-based fee…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage contract lifecycle: renewals, re-competes (W4892), performance-based fee adjustments, dispute/issue resolution, and exit/transition planning (content/playlist portability, avoid lock-in)
Responsible (R): Procurement / Legal / In-Store Media Manager
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4910_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
