    <bpmn:process id="W_W4912" name="W4912. Program Maturity, Benchmarking &amp; Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual program review; benchmark refresh; maturity assessment (VS-133)
Frequency: Annual + continuous improvement
Volume: 1 group program × annual maturity/benchmark cycle
Owner: In-Store Media Manager / OpEx (VS-133) / Strategy (VS-33)
Participants: OpEx (VS-133), Strategy (VS-33), Marketing (VS-14), Analytics (VS-28), Store Ops (VS-07)
Source: workflow W4912 — Program Maturity, Benchmarking &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4912_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4912_Lane1" name="In-Store Media Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4912_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4912_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4912_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4912_Lane2" name="OpEx">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4912_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4912_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4912_Start4" name="Annual program review; benchmark refresh; maturity assessment (VS-133)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4912_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4912_Task5" name="Assess program maturity vs benchmark: royalty-compliance maturity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Assess program maturity vs benchmark: royalty-compliance maturity, music/signage standardization, CX-uplift evidence, cost/co-fund recovery, and tech/cyber maturity; benchmark vs peer big-box retailers and industry norms
Responsible (R): In-Store Media Manager / OpEx / Strategy
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4912_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4912_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4912_Task6" name="Run continuous improvement (VS-133): process-mine the publish→playback→audit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Run continuous improvement (VS-133): process-mine the publish→playback→audit flow, remove manual handoffs (content production, compliance checks, asset tracking), and run an improvement pipeline with benefit realization
Responsible (R): OpEx / In-Store Media Manager / Analytics
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4912_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4912_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4912_Task7" name="Report to leadership &amp; refresh strategy: annual CMO/CFO review, reallocate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Report to leadership &amp; refresh strategy: annual CMO/CFO review, reallocate budget/capex based on maturity/benchmark gaps, and refresh the multi-year roadmap (W4889); close the loop with VS-33 corporate performance
Responsible (R): In-Store Media Manager / Strategy / Marketing Finance
Accountable (A): VP Marketing / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4912_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4912_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4912_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4912_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-736 (ensure controlled execution — Ambient Media Analytics, Technology &amp; Program Assurance (PA-168.3).) | - CTL-736: annual maturity/benchmark review; improvement pipeline with benefit realization; CMO/CFO reallocation review
Owner: In-Store Media Manager / OpEx (VS-133) / Strategy (VS-33)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
